  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-02.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/MXFfGK1ZtT04YzhdRs8UWclCmNo.png",
    "caption": "INSPIRE — This used the hero video or campaign header. Using photography showing real people and real impact. Using big type and sharp copy, leading with the outcome."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-03.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/gbFDELW5So9fXC5h2Kh0I3N6CBs.png",
    "caption": "INSPIRE — Our photography is putting our customers front and center, which is where they belong. We built for our customers. We intentionally don’t show them in a meeting or behind a computer, they are driven by action and conviction. They should inspire ambition and using natural lighting slight upward perspectives we’re trying to accomplish this. Differentiating by showcasing the tangible, human outcomes of our technology rather than the tech itself. Tying back perfectly to our \"Ambition\" brand value by portraying our customers as driven, emotive, and relentless in achieving their goals."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-04.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/1fpdy9L5XRYOrwUbr90vRC7NC4.png",
    "caption": "EXPLAIN — This is the part where we want to give more context about our product. And honestly, our product can be complicated from time to time. That’s why this layer is essential in the scheme of things. We’re showing technical elements relating to our products and data, and illustrations that explain more abstract concepts to our audience."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-05.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/YE06DSRUu6h0RNrZ4gc0DdTytw.png",
    "caption": "EXPLAIN — With less photography we’re actively pursuing the warmth in this element by adding warmer “contextual” colors to our brand in this part."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-06.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/zJv0aX2h3QOLzFZ2JJFGEj398.png",
    "caption": "EXPLAIN — A slight grain is added to our illustrations and graphs to add a similar effect as our cinematic grain-like photography."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-07.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/B0aHK3q0xzhOeHkjmZq98qZ1Y.png",
    "caption": "EXPLAIN — Our illustrations are bridging the gap between technology and a personal touch, by showing human intervention."
  },
  {
