  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-09.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/ezT8Ll8eMEAlL2LVUhzSbiGmIr8.png",
    "caption": "SHOW —  Maybe our proudest moment is when we get to demo our product. Show off how that tech actually works, and how it can benefit our customers business. Product pages or live demo’s showing our product, from physical terminal in real life situations, to technical dashboards."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-10.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/6VRfj1xNtyNyXzqtLfiQ7ENgvA.png",
    "caption": "SHOW — Paired with real-life photography where suitable, we prefer to ground our products in the real world."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-11.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/T90iuetq4zYBwgmqLNgCt4OcE.png",
    "caption": "PROVE — Earlier the data was doing the heavy lifting, now we need to prove the impact it’s making. Here we choose to let our customers and the data do the talking. Our data callouts are designed to do just that."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-12.png",
    "project": "brand refresh",
    "slug": "brand-refresh",
    "kind": "gallery",
    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/q7cgntEHN2gzdbxQmpSzcGkbls.png",
    "caption": "PROVE — Still anchoring it in physical reality by showing the context of our customers in video’s and photography, adding contextual colors. But keeping the data and proof front and center."
  },
  {
    "slot": "brand-refresh/gallery-13.png",
