    "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/FDQM1ddkw2o4pZO4y1DPWnInw5g.png",
    "caption": "PROVE — Where context is needed, we add data visualation. Here we support with warm colors and add grain to balance the facts & figures."
  },
